      "text": "Figured out how to make #music with #PowerShell\n\nJust make .wav files 😎\n\nBeen a fun few days.\n\nMade a synth over a weekend.\n\nGot sine/saw/triangle/square waves working.\n\nDidn't expect them to be so beautiful.  🩵\n\nCode in alt (12 lines!)\n\nBTW, also supports #MIDI & DECPS 🤷😏\n\n#RetroGaming #Tetris"
